@startuml UC22_SSD
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
title UC22: System Sequence Diagram - View In-App Notifications

actor Fan
participant ":System" as System

Fan -> System : openNotifications()
System --> Fan : displayNotificationsList(notifications)
System -> System : fetchUserNotifications(userID)
@enduml
